OL,3,GNEWSA'Holy grail' long lost board game
OL,4,Afound in attic
OL,5,
OL,6,FCurator Tony Boydell confirmed it was
OL,7,F"the rarest Pepys game by a mile" as
OL,8,Fthe game was known about but had never
OL,9,Fbeen seen. It has now been bought by
OL,10,Fthe museum and is on permanent display.
